      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARTLAND BUSTER (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (23.04) at Shepparton behind Moe Patty in a Grade 5. Stalked the pace but found the line strongly. Can go on with it. EAGLE TEGAN (3) hit the ground running and was prominent to the turn but faded out of it when 5th at this track in Grade 5 company. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Worth another chance. MAURITIAN LUCAS (2) missed the frame last time when sixth (23.20) at this track but prior to that had two placings in a row. Form here sound including four wins. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to run well. UNLEASHING (8) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
